.SS 🔗 2. UNIX 管道串接範例 (UNIX Pipe Recipes)
.SS Recipe A: 政府標案履約天數計算 (G50 ↔ G10)
.IP
.EX
\f[I]# 自政府標案 GRB 提取簽約與驗收日期，計算實際履約法定工作天\f[R]
\&./pa g10 search \(dq石門水庫\(dq \-j \f[B]|\f[R] \(rs
  jq \-r \(aq.results[0] | \(dq\(rs(.start_date) \(rs(.end_date)\(dq\(aq \f[B]|\f[R] \(rs
  xargs ./pa g50 range \-j \f[B]|\f[R] jq \(aq{working_days: .total_working_days, holidays: .total_holidays}\(aq
.EE
.SS Recipe B: 農業休市與天災出勤判定 (G50 ↔ GOV\-A19)
.IP
.EX
\f[I]# 串接農產品交易日期，校驗是否為法定補班或例假日\f[R]
\&./pa agro query\-crop \(dq香蕉\(dq \-j \f[B]|\f[R] \(rs
  jq \-r \(aq.[].transaction_date\(aq \f[B]|\f[R] \(rs
  ./pa g50 check \-i \-j \f[B]|\f[R] \(rs
  jq \(aq.[] | select(.is_holiday == true)\(aq
.EE
.PP
